      175.05,
      202.97,
      388.76,
      214.31
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE HESHA FRIENDSHIP FOUNDATION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      226.97,
      401.87,
      286.31
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS a Association called and known as the\u201cHesha Friendship Foundation\u201d has heretofore been formedin Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out andtransacting all objects and matters connected with the saidFoundation according to the rules agreed to by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      298.97,
      401.9,
      358.31
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      370.97,
      401.89,
      394.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      406.97,
      401.85,
      430.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Hesha FriendshipFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      442.97,
      401.9,
      562.31
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the commencement of this Act, suchand so many persons as now are members of the \u201cHeshaFriendship Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted as members ofthe Corporation hereby constituted shall be a body corporatewith perpetual succession, under the name and style of\u201cHesha Friendship Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cCorporation\u201d) and by that name may sue and be suedand have full power and authority to have and use a commonseal and alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      574.97,
      401.87,
      598.31
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      610.97,
      401.88,
      634.31
    ],
    "text": "(a)to provide education, grant scholarships, assist pre-school children;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      647.45,
      401.86,
      671.03
    ],
    "text": "(b)to provide provision to protect, maintain disciplineand cultural ethics;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      444.67,
      455.86,
      492.14
    ],
    "text": "Incorporationof theHeshaFriendshipFoundation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
