    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      202.73,
      337.17,
      214.07
    ],
    "text": "(c)to promote education and research;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      225.29,
      397.19,
      259.07
    ],
    "text": "(d)to implement academic and training programsrelevant for environment conservation of ruralareas;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      270.05,
      397.19,
      303.83
    ],
    "text": "(e)to extend support to services rendered by seniorcitizens organizations and to encourage suchorganization:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      314.93,
      397.19,
      337.43
    ],
    "text": "(f)to establish information technology centres for theadvancement of scientific studies;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      348.53,
      397.18,
      382.19
    ],
    "text": "(g)to implement social mobilization programs andeducational and training programs for thedevelopment of the children and women;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      393.29,
      397.2,
      427.07
    ],
    "text": "(h)to assist in the development of educational,religious, cultural, aesthetic and sports facilitieswithout any reference to race, religion or cast;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      438.05,
      397.18,
      482.99
    ],
    "text": "(i)to take necessary steps to promote artistics creation,sport skills and technical knowledge of schoolleavers and to set up vocational training centers;and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      494.09,
      397.17,
      516.59
    ],
    "text": "(j)to liaise and co-ordinate with other local or foreigninstitutions which have similar objects.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      527.69,
      397.19,
      595.07
    ],
    "text": "4.(1) The management of the affairs of the Corporationshall, subject to the rules corporation, be administered byCommittee of Management consisting of not more thaneleven office bearers inclusive of the Chairman, Secretary,Treasurer and such number of members as may be providedor in rules and elected in accordance therewith.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      606.05,
      397.2,
      674.39
    ],
    "text": "(2) The first Committee of Management shall consist ofthe members of the Committee of Management holding officeon the day immediately preceding the date of commencementof this Act and shall continue to hold office until a newCommittee of Management is elected in accordance withthe rules section 6 of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
