    "text": "7.All debts and liabilities of the Foundation on theday preceding the date of commencement of this Act, shallbe paid and discharged by the Corporation herebyconstituted and all debts due to, subscriptions andcontributions payable to the Foundation on that day shallbe paid to the Corporation for purposes of this Act.",
